  "configuration_id": "config_025",
  "reason": "The current best (config_019, 0.639 acc) uses multimodal + multiprofile + pca_n2000 + resnet50 + avgpool + weighted. All design axes except the image encoder have been validated: avgpool > transformer, weighted > concat, multiprofile > single, and multimodal > RNA-only. The image encoder is the only unexplored dimension in the best configuration. Image-only resnet50 scored only 0.208, suggesting the image signal may be underutilized; a larger ViT-L encoder (imagenet_vit_l) could extract richer spatial features that complement the RNA modality. Config_025 changes only the image encoder from resnet50 to imagenet_vit_l while keeping all other validated settings identical, isolating the encoder effect. This is the highest-information single-variable test: if it improves, we confirm a better image encoder is the key lever; if not, we confirm resnet50 is sufficient and can focus remaining budget on other axes. With 2 experiments left, this cleanly partitions the remaining search space."
}

